---
import Section from '@/components/Section.astro';
import { expertise } from '@/data/site';
---
<Section id="about" title="Physical intuition. Computational discipline.">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-copy" data-reveal><p class="about-lead">I am a computational scientist interested in how complex systems behave — and how to build models that are useful, testable and clear.</p><p>At HR Wallingford, I study sediment transport and scour through multiphase CFD. My PhD research at The Open University connects numerical modelling with laboratory evidence.</p><p>Before this, I worked on wind-turbine aerodynamics, turbulent urban flows and flow-meter design. Across these problems, the method is familiar: formulate a hypothesis, design an experiment, examine the data and refine the model.</p><p>I now bring the same approach to machine learning: reproducible Python, careful model selection and explicit treatment of uncertainty. My AI / ML capstone explores how to choose useful experiments when data are limited.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/nishchayoxford">See how I work in code ↗</a></div>
    <div class="toolbox" data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">Working toolkit</p>{expertise.map((item,i) => <div class="toolbox-row"><span class="toolbox-index">0{i+1}</span><div><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.description}</p><span class="toolbox-detail">{item.detail}</span></div></div>)}</div>
  </div>
</Section>
